```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph RequestLifecycle["Request Lifecycle"]
        Client["HTTP Client"]
        Nginx["Nginx Reverse Proxy"]
        FastAPI["FastAPI Application"]
        Router["Router Layer"]
        Service["Service Layer"]
        Repository["Repository Layer"]
        ORM["SQLAlchemy ORM"]
        DB["PostgreSQL"]
    end

    Client -->|GET /api/v1/tasks| Nginx
    Nginx -->|Proxy| FastAPI
    FastAPI -->|Route matching| Router
    Router -->|Depends注入| Service
    Service -->|Business logic| Repository
    Repository -->|SQL queries| ORM
    ORM -->|Execute| DB
    DB -->|Results| ORM
    ORM -->|ORM objects| Repository
    Repository -->|Entities| Service
    Service -->|Pydantic models| Router
    Router -->|JSON response| FastAPI
    FastAPI -->|HTTP 200| Nginx
    Nginx -->|Response| Client

    style Client fill:#3d1f1f,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style Nginx fill:#1a332e,stroke:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style FastAPI fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style DB fill:#3d2b1f,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fff
```
